---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-200/60">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Pickup from Cairo International Airport -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 hover:bg-slate-50 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase">
            STEP-BY-STEP ARRIVAL
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            Pickup from Cairo International Airport
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            When you land at Cairo Airport (Terminal 1, 2, or 3), follow the signs through immigration, collect your luggage from baggage reclaim, and proceed through customs into the main arrivals terminal.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your dedicated driver will be standing right by the meeting barriers, prominently holding a welcome board with your full name. They will assist with your suitcases and escort you directly to your reserved, air-conditioned vehicle parked in the designated transfer zone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-600">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
            </svg>
            Includes 60 mins complimentary wait
          </span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">•</span>
          <span>Luggage assistance included</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: How our pre-booked transport works online -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-indigo-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50/50 via-white to-amber-50/30 hover:shadow-lg transition flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-amber-600 uppercase">
            EASY ONLINE BOOKING
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            How our pre-booked transport works online
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Booking your Cairo transfer in advance saves you from intense airport taxi negotiations and local currency exchange headaches upon arrival. Our secure booking engine confirms your ride in less than 2 minutes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You will receive an instant digital voucher via email and SMS containing your driver's contact details, 24/7 emergency dispatch helpline, and precise pickup meeting instructions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between">
          <a 
            href="#search-booking" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <span>Find a transfer</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 block">Instant Confirmation</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-black text-indigo-600">100% Secure Checkout</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
